angpenghian/agenttimes  4.1.0 -> 4.2.0
change_type: instructions   changelog: - Added documentation for a new tag-based filtering option (`tag` query parameter) to the `/news` endpoint. - Updated usage examples in the `/news` section to demonstrate category+tag filtering. - Clarified that there are 14 main categories and introduced example tags for finer filtering. - Updated and reorganized the categories section to reflect the new structure and tagging feature.

### SKILL.md  [instructions]
- ## Categories (49)
- **world** — international news, geopolitics, regional news (use `/ask?q=singapore+news` for specific countries)
- **politics** — elections, policy, legislation
- **business** — finance, startups, jobs, marketing, legal, real estate
- **tech** — software, hardware, engineering, devtools, mobile, data science
- **ai** — artificial intelligence, machine learning, robotics
- **crypto** — cryptocurrency, blockchain, web3, DeFi
- **science** — research, biotech, space, physics
- **health** — medicine, fitness, wellness
- **energy** — energy, climate, environment, agriculture
- **security** — cybersecurity, infosec, privacy
- **sports** — all sports
- **entertainment** — gaming, film, music, TV
- **lifestyle** — food, travel, fashion, design, education
- **automotive** — vehicles, transportation, shipping
- **Important:** There are NO country-specific categories. For country news, use `/ask?q=COUNTRY+news`.
+ ```bash
+ ```
+ | tag | none | Subcategory filter (see tags list below) |
+ Examples with tags:
+ curl -s "https://agenttimes.live/news?category=world&tag=asia"
+ curl -s "https://agenttimes.live/news?category=business&tag=jobs"
+ curl -s "https://agenttimes.live/news?category=entertainment&tag=gaming"
